## AUTH & ROLES

### Cek role di page/component:
```typescript
// Di Server Component:
const supabase = await createClient()
const { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser()
const { data: profile } = await supabase
  .from('profiles')
  .select('role, is_approved')
  .eq('user_id', user?.id)
  .single()

if (profile?.role !== 'admin' && profile?.role !== 'superadmin') {
  redirect('/dashboard')
}
```

### Hierarki role:
```
superadmin > admin > user
superadmin bisa akses semua route
admin bisa akses semua route kecuali /superadmin/*
user hanya bisa akses /dashboard /students /kedisiplinan /prestasi /account
```

